# ReadPropertyMultiple (§15.7): requests, and answers that carry a value or
# an error per property.

00 05 01 0e 0c 00 00 00 01 1e 09 55 09 6f 09 75 1f => read-property-multiple analog-input:1 [present-value, status-flags, units]
# Every property of one object, and one slot of another's priority array.
00 05 02 0e 0c 00 00 00 01 1e 09 08 1f 0c 00 40 00 01 1e 09 57 19 08 1f => read-property-multiple analog-input:1 [all]; analog-output:1 [priority-array index 8]
# Two values and an error: description is not a property this object has.
30 01 0e 0c 00 00 00 01 1e 29 55 4e 44 42 c8 00 00 4f 29 6f 4e 82 04 00 4f 29 1c 5e 91 02 91 20 5f 1f => read-property-multiple-ack analog-input:1 present-value = real 100.0, status-flags = bits 0000, description = error property: unknown-property
# Two objects answered.
30 02 0e 0c 00 00 00 01 1e 29 55 4e 44 42 c8 00 00 4f 1f 0c 00 40 00 01 1e 29 57 39 08 4e 44 42 70 00 00 4f 1f => read-property-multiple-ack analog-input:1 present-value = real 100.0; analog-output:1 priority-array index 8 = real 60.0
# A result that is neither a value nor an error.
30 03 0e 0c 00 00 00 01 1e 29 55 1f => error missing-field 5
